{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果正在開發一款名為Harbor的新應用程式，旨在將搭載Apple Silicon晶片的Mac電腦變成私人AI推理伺服器。與傳統本地AI軟件不同，Harbor不僅能夠在單台Mac上運行大型語言模型，還可以通過雷靂5（Thunderbolt 5）接口連接多台Mac，將不同設備的統一內存整合為一個更大的計算資源池，從而運行單台電腦無法獨立容納的AI模型。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585878.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.475575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:03:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"8498e0502275fb4e5b187249ad41b5e4029651d61cf7efd6437a05573e537f33","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}